# ============================================
# LoopRuntime — .gitignore
# Monorepo: TypeScript (CLI) + Go (API + Operators) + Infra
# ============================================

# --------------------------------------------
# OS & Editor
# --------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
prompts
# Driver prompts for .claude/ halt-loop skills are part of the ecosystem contract
# (per-skill ralph-loop driver). Override the generic `prompts` rule above.
!.claude/skills/**/prompts/
!.claude/skills/**/prompts/**
continue.txt
.yarn
MELHORIAS.txt
ralph-loop.local.md
.claude/ralph-loop.local.md
*.tgz
code-review-output-infra-tests/
project-purge-output/
architecture-output/
